      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4912,
        "name": "娜布·瑪莉卡塔",
        "desc": "<p>花神，大慈樹王與赤王的摯友。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/18/142453215/54fc33ab94abb4b00460e448f7765892_8364695677634385535.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "娜布·瑪莉卡塔創造了靈光，其後化作神鳥西摩格。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4910,
        "name": "大慈樹王",
        "desc": "<p>初代草神，也是智慧之神。娜布·瑪莉卡塔與赤王的摯友。為了不讓世界樹繼續遭受禁忌知識的汙染，大慈樹王從世界樹中被徹底抹除。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/10/18/142453215/41cf18c09152213a5353f9588eecd2a6_1221687757639373890.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "大慈樹王將靈光化作神鳥西摩格以守護森林。誕生自西摩格的花靈原為大慈樹王的眷屬，自從有關大慈樹王的記憶從",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7087,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "抹除後，花靈如今被視為",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7471,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "text"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "的眷屬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 4780,
        "name": "厄歌莉婭",
        "desc": "<p>楓丹前代水神，殞歿於500年前的大災厄中。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2023/12/20/a5b8d23dd3fbe0969cc3ebce78f9c29f_8021351765588020911.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "厄歌莉婭死後，她化作一片由純淨甘露所形成的湖泊。西摩格飲下甘露後，身軀碎散為數以百萬的碎片。自那些碎片中，花靈誕生了。\n西摩格\n一隻神鳥，花靈自祂身軀誕生。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7033,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "草神的眷屬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 5744,
        "name": "戴因斯雷布",
        "desc": "<p>坎瑞亞末代宮廷衛隊的「末光之劍」，蒙受了來自天空島的不死詛咒。 </p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/07/19/7998136/385d810ab3166799fc6ea831619f5ef6_5231478583624530994.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 10
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "災變期間，戴因斯雷布與最初的花靈——祖爾宛並肩作戰。\n旅行者的手足\n災變期間，旅行者的手足與最初的花靈——祖爾宛並肩作戰。\n矯論團\n矯論團欺騙了花靈，以奪取靈光絕唱。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 20,
        "name": "旅行者",
        "desc": "從世界之外漂流而來的旅行者，被神帶走血親，自此踏上尋找七神之路。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/character/Traveler_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 2
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "勇者斯露莎的謁頌主。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "著名花靈"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3829,
        "name": "祖爾宛",
        "desc": "<p>一隻誕生於甘露花海的花靈，為人所知的最初的花靈。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/285069609/0987bc70b51b17406a88efddf714172b_6250738932426758242.PNG",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "最初的花靈。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3827,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "靈光認可的勇者。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3826,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "荊棘眷屬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3825,
        "desc": "",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "跋爾松之眷屬。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3824,
        "name": "瑟法娜",
        "desc": "<p>一隻誕生於甘露花海，悉心照料著淨覺花的花靈——瑟法娜。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/06/285069609/b971abb5511eb82efd51da203a999c4d_733568532539031687.PNG",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "照顧淨覺花的花靈。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3823,
        "name": "賈爾賈",
        "desc": "<p>一隻誕生於甘露花海，喜歡設計名為「浮光鳴照」挑戰任務的花靈——賈爾賈。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/08/285069609/bb411ee24c98ae2de8176fd0003e9335_7609285440096670707.PNG",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "創造浮光鳴照的花靈。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3828,
        "name": "菲多赫",
        "desc": "<p>一隻誕生於甘露花海，守望著甘露池的花靈——菲多赫。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/08/285069609/e6c92c89bba136838a50ad3d50f8ef78_9004371109670228452.PNG",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "守望著甘露池的花靈。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相關詞條"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3757,
        "name": "斯露莎（一）",
        "desc": "<p>作為守護大地的花靈一族，斯露莎立志要成為平息災厄的勇者。</p><p>在與信賴之人建立連結後，斯露莎將會同她的「謁頌主」一起穿行於滿布汙穢的大地...</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/10/125391187/840d860620a0fc38f1b41a16a7a10617_6451105603750794256.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3756,
        "name": "斯露莎（二）",
        "desc": "<p>作為誕生於花海的花靈的一員，斯露莎乃是為靈光所認可的勇者。</p><p>在與信賴之人建立連結後，斯露莎將會同她的「謁頌主」一起穿行於靈光護佑的大地...</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/10/125391187/0ff1dbbf93bc0c9aac2cc030ca1432f8_2790096117929511086.png",
